@startuml domain-model
!include ../../sellStocks/diagrams/sell-style.puml
title The current portfolio aggregate
caption Main baseline — selected fields and operations
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #EAF3F9
skinparam ClassBorderColor #B7CCDE
hide circle
class Portfolio <<aggregate root>> {
 balance : Money
 buy(ticker, quantity, price)
 sell(ticker, quantity, price) : SellResult
}
class Holding <<entity>> {
 ticker : Ticker
 sell(quantity, price) : SellResult
 getTotalShares() : ShareQuantity
}
class Lot <<entity>> {
 purchasedAt : LocalDateTime
 remainingShares : ShareQuantity
 unitPrice : Price
 reduce(quantity)
}
class SellResult <<record>> {
 proceeds : Money
 costBasis : Money
 profit : Money
 of(proceeds, costBasis)
}
Portfolio "1" *-- "0..*" Holding
Holding "1" *-- "0..*" Lot : FIFO order
Portfolio ..> SellResult
note bottom of Lot
 Depleted lots are removed;
 empty holdings remain.
 No settlement or reservation fields.
end note
note right of Portfolio
 Intended consistency boundary.
 Public children remain mutable.
end note
@enduml
